cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Under CC BY 4.0, credit "Source: genie-artificiel.com"
  with a link to https://www.genie-artificiel.com/en/ai-data/ai-video-price-history/ and to the license.
type: dataset
title: "AI video, avatar and voice tool pricing history (2024-2026)"
abstract: >-
  128 observations of the cheapest paid plans of 15 AI video, avatar and voice tools (Runway, Kling AI,
  Luma Dream Machine, Hailuo AI (MiniMax), Pika, Vidu, PixVerse, InVideo AI, Synthesia, HeyGen, Colossyan,
  D-ID, ElevenLabs, Murf, Descript), from 2024-05-20 to 2026-10-16, read from their official pricing pages
  archived by the Wayback Machine, then from the live pages: monthly and annual price, included quota,
  newest model, seconds or minutes produced per month, credit conversion, confidence level and source URL.
  Column dictionary included.
